Error [E0119]: This body doesn't match typed-literal head `[U8]`
  --> tests/ui/byte_literal_non_ascii.jet:2:14
    |
  2 |     bytes :: [U8]{"café"}
    |              ^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: A typed literal body uses the head type's own literal shape
 Fix: Use ASCII text or numeric elements for a byte list
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0119
